{"4421150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chaos Playground", "steam_appid": 4421150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective</strong><br>Jump in as a ragdoll or just watch the chaos unfold! Spawn AI, set up scenarios, or dive straight into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox</strong><br>Create your own worlds and experiment with physics. Build crazy setups, test ideas, or simply enjoy the unpredictable results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ragdoll AI</strong><br>Spawn AI ragdolls and organize them into groups. Watch them fight, explore, and collapse into ragdolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building</strong><br>Spawn objects, many of which have adjustable settings. Change their size, strength, or behavior, and experiment freely to create arenas, contraptions, or small physics simulations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead battles, experiment, and watch the mayhem — physics has never been this fun.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective</strong><br>Jump in as a ragdoll or just watch the chaos unfold! Spawn AI, set up scenarios, or dive straight into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox</strong><br>Create your own worlds and experiment with physics. Build crazy setups, test ideas, or simply enjoy the unpredictable results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ragdoll AI</strong><br>Spawn AI ragdolls and organize them into groups. Watch them fight, explore, and collapse into ragdolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building</strong><br>Spawn objects, many of which have adjustable settings. Change their size, strength, or behavior, and experiment freely to create arenas, contraptions, or small physics simulations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead battles, experiment, and watch the mayhem — physics has never been this fun.</p>", "short_description": "A physics-driven ragdoll sandb